      "id": "UTM-SDEF-01",
      "file": "Whisky/WhiskyKit/Sources/WhiskyKit/Runtime/WindowsGuestTransport.swift",
      "issue": "Real UTM 5.0.9 AppleScript fails with error -1700 on `architecture of (configuration of vm) as text` because `configuration` is an AppleScript record value rather than an object element.",
      "fix": "Evaluate `set vmConfig to configuration of vm` into a local variable first, then read `architecture of vmConfig as text`.",
      "realGuestVerified": true
    },
    {
      "id": "UTM-SDEF-02",
      "file": "Whisky/WhiskyKit/Sources/WhiskyKit/Runtime/WindowsGuestTransport.swift",
      "issue": "`stop ... by request` sends an ACPI shutdown hint that can be ignored during `waitForAgent` timeout rollback, leaving the QEMU VM stranded in `.started` state.",
      "fix": "Align `stopScript` with `utmctl stop` default (`by force`) so timeout rollback and `provider.stop()` reliably transition the QEMU VM to `.stopped`.",
      "realGuestVerified": true
    },
    {
      "id": "UTM-SDEF-03",
      "file": "Whisky/WhiskyKit/Sources/WhiskyKit/Runtime/WindowsGuestTransport.swift",
      "issue": "QGA `open file ... for writing` fails if the destination parent directory does not yet exist in the Windows guest; chained `push of (open file ...)` also risks AppleEvent specifier evaluation errors.",
      "fix": "Separate `open file` and `push ... with closing`, and add `pushCreatingParentDirectory` to create missing guest parent directories via `cmd.exe /d /c if not exist <parent> mkdir <parent>` before retrying push.",
      "realGuestVerified": true
    },
    {
      "id": "UTM-SDEF-04",
      "file": "Whisky/WhiskyKit/Sources/WhiskyKit/Runtime/WindowsGuestTransport.swift",
      "issue": "`terminate` treated nonzero `taskkill.exe` exit code as `automationFailed` even when the target PID exited naturally just before `taskkill.exe` ran.",
      "fix": "Re-check `result(identifier, pid: pid) != nil` when `taskkill.exe` returns nonzero; treat an already-exited target process as successful termination.",
      "realGuestVerified": true
    },
    {
      "id": "UTM-PROBE-05",
      "file": "Whisky/WhiskyKit/Sources/WhiskyKit/Runtime/WindowsGuestProbeService.swift",
      "issue": "`UTMWindowsGuestProvider` did not conform to `WindowsGuestProbeReporting`, and `collectOutput` failed when `trimmingCharacters(in: .whitespacesAndNewlines)` stripped trailing empty lines while process exited state was still `0`.",
      "fix": "Implement `WindowsGuestProbeReporting.collectSelfProbeReport(nonce:)` on `UTMWindowsGuestProvider` using UTM 5.0.9 `execute ... with output capturing` and parse `state == \"0\"` prior to requiring output fields.",
      "realGuestVerified": true
    }
